{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32404","headline":"访知玄上人遇暴经因有赠 · 温庭筠","name":"访知玄上人遇暴经因有赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"缥帙无尘满画廊，锺山弟子静焚香。\n惠能未肯传心法，张湛徒劳与眼方。\n风扬檀烟销篆印，日移松影过禅牀。\n客儿自有翻经处，江上秋来蕙草荒。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32404.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32404","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}